OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMist and fog patches clearing
OL,6,Ffor a cloudier day today, with chance
OL,7,Fof a light shower feeding in from the
OL,8,Feast. Although, the far west holding
OL,9,Fon to the best of any sunshine and
OL,10,Fremaining dry. Temperatures, around
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny showers dissipate, for a
OL,14,Flargely dry night with clear spells.
OL,15,FFeeling chilly, with a touch of frost
OL,16,Fin places and fog patches developing
OL,17,Funder light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
