OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FRemaining dry with sunny
OL,6,Fspells further north, cloudier further
OL,7,Fsouth with chance for a few light
OL,8,Fshowers. Around average temperatures.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FSunny
OL,11,Fspells inbetween variable cloud with a
OL,12,Ffew scattered showers, these remaining
OL,13,Flight. Temperatures dipping below
OL,14,Faverage by night with some isolated
OL,15,Ffrost and patches of fog developing.
